-output-display execution_count=13}\n```\n0.0003141592653589793\n```\n:::\n:::\n\n\nThen NaCl mass in each cell, for each time, in kg, is:\n\n::: {#b2712b25 .cell execution_count=15}\n``` {.python .cell-code}\npred['c'] * pred['dx'] * area\n```\n\n::: {.cell-output .cell-output-display execution_count=14}\n```\narray([[0.00000000e+00, 2.49421896e-04, 2.69251319e-04, 2.77635602e-04,\n        2.82732254e-04, 2.86064065e-04, 2.88547582e-04, 2.90453887e-04,\n        2.92009780e-04, 2.93277942e-04],\n       [0.00000000e+00, 1.37425638e-04, 1.85316532e-04, 2.08038525e-04,\n        2.21733749e-04, 2.31299087e-04, 2.38376119e-04, 2.43920280e-04,\n        2.48382628e-04, 2.52106661e-04],\n       [0.00000000e+00, 6.34718802e-05, 1.16369949e-04, 1.46569674e-04,\n        1.66430238e-04, 1.80543055e-04, 1.91299281e-04, 1.99808768e-04,\n        2.06787697e-04, 2.12613699e-04],\n       [0.00000000e+00, 2.48565392e-05, 6.65896995e-05, 9.71906533e-05,\n        1.19174291e-04, 1.35846389e-04, 1.48914113e-04, 1.59523350e-04,\n        1.68320629e-04, 1.75794639e-04],\n       [0.00000000e+00, 8.37372555e-06, 3.47093312e-05, 6.03407458e-05,\n        8.14166805e-05, 9.83961694e-05, 1.12346107e-04, 1.23980773e-04,\n        1.33878198e-04, 1.42391002e-04],\n       [0.00000000e+00, 2.46083296e-06, 1.65299143e-05, 3.52125570e-05,\n        5.29279539e-05, 6.85570476e-05, 8.20576180e-05, 9.37638621e-05,\n        1.03956936e-04, 1.12934159e-04],\n       [0.00000000e+00, 6.39124700e-07, 7.21075570e-06, 1.92318828e-05,\n        3.27960887e-05, 4.59116490e-05, 5.80051404e-05, 6.89339917e-05,\n        7.87866307e-05, 8.76502108e-05],\n       [0.00000000e+00, 1.48412189e-07, 2.89401032e-06, 9.88883249e-06,\n        1.93210733e-05, 2.95484219e-05, 3.96520780e-05, 4.92670994e-05,\n        5.82336981e-05, 6.65520696e-05],\n       [0.00000000e+00, 3.11274852e-08, 1.07202596e-06, 4.76820781e-06,\n        1.08571288e-05, 1.82693941e-05, 2.62160527e-05, 3.41994533e-05,\n        4.19794040e-05, 4.94102296e-0